can represent these is schizophrenia.\n(Option A) Antisocial personality disorder is characterized by continuous antisocial or criminal\nacts, inability to conform to social rules, impulsivity, disregard for the rights of others,\naggressiveness, lack of remorse, and deceitfulness. There are no delusions or hallucinations,\nunless caused by another reason.\n(Option B) Opium abuse is not associated with delusions or hallucinations.\n(Option C) Acute alcohol intoxication presents varying manifestations depending on the severity,\nand can include slurred speech, nystagmus, disinhibited behavior, incoordination, unsteady gait,\nmemory impairment, stupor or even coma. Hallucinations and delusions are not typical\npresentations.\n(Option E) Borderline personality disorder is often characterised by an unstable affect, mood\nswings, marked impulsivity, unstable relationships, recurrent suicidal behaviours and self-inflicted\ninjures, chronic feelings of emptiness and boredom, identity disturbances, and inappropriate anger.\nIf they are stressed they may become psychotic. They use splitting as their main defence\nmechanism.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"medium","currentness_keywords":["pregnan"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"e74e8f551c6e8d22802cf1a68ac86143c00429ac","duplicate_group_id":"exact-e74e8f551c6e","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"aafb2fac9ee95642d42e","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":1530,"source_qid":null}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
