n\nexternal context and cultural factors that might influence symptom severity and presentation\nare taken into account and/or (2) significant impairment in social, occupational, or other\nareas of functioning.\nThe stress-related disturbance does not meet criteria for another mental disorder and is not\nmerely an exacerbation of a preexisting mental disorder.\nThe symptoms do not represent normal bereavement\nAfter the termination of the stressor (or its consequences), the symptoms persist for no\nlonger than an additional 6 months\nRoyal College of Australian General Practitioners (RACGP) has proposed a model for interacting\nwith patients with psychological distress and disturbances regardless of the underlying etiology.\nThis approach model consists of three steps:\nSTEP 1- Establishing rapport using active listening and empathy, non-directional supportive\npsychotherapy, and psycho-education. Then if required:\nSTEP 2- Cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT), interpersonal psychotherapy and interpersonal\ncounselling, structured problem solving, behavioral therapy, and family therapy. Then if\nrequired:\nSTEP 3- Intensive therapy (e.g., use of medications)","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["age","management","therapy"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"8bb706ee85908ad50b3f38c8842e0899f3170984","duplicate_group_id":"exact-8bb706ee8590","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"405dbeb49a3d5bd0cec1","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":1630,"source_qid":null}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
